# Dockerfile

A Dockerfile contains instructions used to build a Docker image.

## Example

```dockerfile
FROM nginx:latest

COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html

EXPOSE 80

IMPORTANT NOTE : 

Instructions Used
FROM
Defines the base image.
COPY
Copies files from the Docker build context into the image.
EXPOSE
Documents the port the application is intended to use.
EXPOSE does not publish the port to the host.

